# Whitelist strategy: this working folder also holds ~2.6 GB of raw source
# photography and a 1.3 GB zip archive. Ignoring everything by default and
# opting files in makes it impossible to stage those by accident.

/*

# --- Tracked files ---
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/.nojekyll
!/README.md
!/index.html
!/brand/

# Never track, even if moved inside a whitelisted folder
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.zip
*.mov
*.MOV
*.mp4
*.heic
*.HEIC
